4-09</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Qwen 2.5（72B 旗舰）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>代码/数学/长文本强化；闭源 Qwen2.5-Max 同步（</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>双轨启动</span></strong><span>）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2025-04</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Qwen 3（MoE 235B-A22B / 30B-A3B + 6 dense）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>混合推理</span></strong><section><span>（思考/非思考双模式）；36T 数据；119 语言</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2025-07</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Qwen3-Coder（480B-A35B）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Agentic 编程：agent RL 训练；256K→1M 上下文</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2025-09</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Qwen3-VL / Omni /&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Qwen3-Max</span></strong></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>视觉智能体；端到端全模态；</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>1T 闭源旗舰 SOTA</span></strong></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2025-11~2026</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Qwen3-Max-Thinking / Qwen3.7-Max / 3.8 Max</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>深度推理满分；闭源旗舰持续迭代</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、三条主线：语言 · 架构 · 双轨</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>阿里的进化围绕三条主线交叉推进：</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>语言线</span></strong><span>：中英（1）→ 12 语（1.5）→ 27 语（2）→&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>119 语（3）</span></strong><span>——开源模型语言覆盖最广。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>架构线</span></strong><span>：Dense（1-2.5）→&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MoE + 混合推理（3）</span></strong><span>——235B-A22B 与 30B-A3B 大小稀疏组合拳。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>双轨线</span></strong><span>：开源全家桶（0.6B→235B→1T 蒸馏家族）+ 闭源旗舰（Max）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>开源抢生态、闭源抢产品</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、关键技术点详解</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>1. 中文原生基座（Qwen 1）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>中文 tokenizer 更省 token、中文能力更强——「语言适配 = 产品定位」；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Apache 2.0 商用许可——先拿中文市场，再打全球。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2. 全尺寸矩阵 + 多语言（Qwen 1.5/2）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>0.5B~72B 全矩阵：端侧到旗舰一个生态通吃；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>GQA（分组查询注意力）：提速降显存（llm-理论 04 效率件）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>27 语言 + 128K 上下文：对标 Llama 3 全面对齐。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>3. 数据与后训练强化（Qwen 2.5）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>18T 数据 + 代码/数学/长文本专项强化——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>后训练工程决定旗舰口碑</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>闭源 Max 同步上线：开源 vs 闭源同源双轨成型。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>4. 混合推理：思考 / 非思考双模式（Qwen 3）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>一个模型两种模式：Thinking（逐步思考，可设预算）/ Non-Thinking（快速直答）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>RL 把「非思考」无缝融入「思考」模型——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>「想多久」变成用户可调参数</span></strong><span>；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>与 GPT-5 reasoning effort、Claude thinking 同代同思路。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>5. MoE 大小组合拳（Qwen 3）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>235B-A22B（旗舰）+ 30B-A3B（小稀疏：30B 打 QwQ-32B 的 10 倍激活差距）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Coder 480B-A35B：agent RL 训练编程；数据 36T、119 语言。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>6. 全模态与闭源旗舰（Qwen3 下半年）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Qwen3-VL-235B：视觉智能体（操作电脑/手机界面、GUI 识别）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Qwen3-Omni：端到端全模态（文/图/音/视频）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Qwen3-Max（1T 参数）</span></strong><span>：开源时代 SOTA（Tau2-Bench 74.8 超 Claude Opus 4）；Thinking 版数学满分。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>7. 衍生生态第一（贯穿全程）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>基于 Qwen 的衍生模型 17 万 +，</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>全球第一（超 LLaMA）</span></strong><span>——开源战略的回报。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>∞</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>CONCLUSION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、进化逻辑总结（学习重点）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>语言做「加法」</span></strong><span>：中英 → 119 语——语言覆盖是差异化第一战场。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>架构做「双模」</span></strong><span>：混合推理（思考/非思考）+ MoE（大稀疏/小稀疏）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>深度与成本都可调</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>双轨做「同源」</span></strong><span>：开源抢生态、闭源抢产品，共享一套技术栈——生态与商业并行。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>能力做「全模态 + Agent」</span></strong><span>：VL/Omni/Coder——从「会说话」到「会看、会写代码、会操作界面」。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>对比</span></strong><span>：与 DeepSeek（效率极致）、LLaMA（生态基座）构成开源三极；混合推理是 Qwen 的差异化招牌。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、资料源（供深入阅读）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Qwen 官方博客：</span><span>https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Qwen3 发布（2025-04）：</span><span>https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/qwen3/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>Qwen3-Coder（2025-07）：</span><span>https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/qwen3-coder/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>学习路径：本开篇 → 01~03 分篇 → 对照 llm-基础理论 04/05/06</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方技术报告。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:33:30+0800"}